# 👩‍💻 SAP Project Portfolio – Subashri A

## 📌 Project: Employee Lifecycle Management using SAP SuccessFactors (EC)

---

## 📖 Overview

This project demonstrates the implementation of an **Employee Lifecycle Management System** using SAP SuccessFactors Employee Central (EC).
It focuses on automating HR processes such as onboarding, employee data management, and workflow approvals.

---

## 🔄 System Workflow

### 🟢 Employee Onboarding

* HR creates new employee records
* Captures personal, job, and organizational details

### 🔵 Employee Data Management

* Maintain and update:

  * Personal information
  * Job role & department
  * Contact details

### 🟣 Job & Position Management

* Assign roles and positions
* Manage promotions and transfers

### 🟡 Leave & Approval Workflow

* Employees apply for leave
* Managers approve or reject requests
* Automated workflow handling

### 🟠 Self-Service Features

**Employee Self-Service (ESS):**

* Update personal details

**Manager Self-Service (MSS):**

* Approve requests
* Manage team data

---

